==Trivia==
*[[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]] gave Mer-Cat the [[Survive|Survive]] ability.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Mer-Cat was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Princes Wanted (Removed Combo)|Princes Wanted]] and [[Helmetheads (Removed Combo)|Helmetheads]].
*In Mer-Cat's description "a mermaid who came onshore to meet a prince" could be a reference to [[wikia:disney:Ariel|Ariel]] from [[wikipedia:The Little Mermaid|The Little Mermaid]].
**The Japanese description of Commando Cat is also a reference to the plot, where in pursuit of the prince, the mermaid, aided by an enchantress, exchanged her voice for legs, enabling her to walk on land.

